# A RELAY-FORW from a relay on the client's link (RFC 8415 section 9), reconstructed by hand:
# hop count 0, link address 2001:db8:1::1, the client's link-local address as the peer
# address, an Interface-Id, a Remote-Id (RFC 4649), a Client Link-Layer Address (RFC 6939)
# and the Relay Message that holds the SOLICIT of solicit-dhclient.hex.
#
# msg-type RELAY-FORW, hop count 0
0c 00
# link address 2001:db8:1::1
20 01 0d b8 00 01 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 01
# peer address fe80::200:5eff:fe00:5301
fe 80 00 00 00 00 00 00 02 00 5e ff fe 00 53 01
# option 18, interface-id, 4 octets: "eth1"
00 12 00 04 65 74 68 31
# option 37, remote-id, 8 octets: enterprise 32473 (0x7ed9, the documentation number of
# RFC 5612) and the identifier 01 02 03 04
00 25 00 08
00 00 7e d9
01 02 03 04
# option 79, client link-layer address, 8 octets: hardware type 1, the MAC
00 4f 00 08
00 01 00 00 5e 00 53 01
# option 9, relay message, 48 octets: the SOLICIT of solicit-dhclient.hex
00 09 00 30
01 4a 6b 1c
00 01 00 0a
00 03 00 01 00 00 5e 00 53 01
00 08 00 02 00 00
00 06 00 04 00 17 00 18
00 03 00 0c
5e 00 53 01
00 00 00 00
00 00 00 00
